   "title": "KAI delivers first 2 FA-50 fighter jets to Malaysia",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/economy/20261102/kai-delivers-first-2-fa-50-fighter-jets-to-malaysia",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
