   "title": "Gunmen kill soldier, steal weapons at Plateau checkpoint",
   "url": "https://www.premiumtimesng.com/news/more-news/922036-gunmen-kill-soldier-steal-weapons-at-plateau-checkpoint.html",
   "domain": "premiumtimesng.com",
