   "title": "Yobe Govt Trains Finance Directors, Other Financial Managers In AI, Blockchain, Forensic Analytics",
   "url": "https://leadership.ng/yobe-govt-trains-finance-directors-other-financial-managers-in-ai-blockchain-forensic-analytics/",
   "domain": "leadership.ng",
