   "published": "Mon, 02 Nov 2026 08:42:34 +0000",
   "_dt": 1793608954.0,
   "ageDays": 0.03,
   "summary": "The programme brings together key public-sector professionals, including Directors of Finance, Directors of Internal Audit, Accountants, Budget Officers, Financial Managers and other relevant officials. It is also expected to expose participants to emerging digital solutions that can improve financial reporting, budget implementation, risk management and the overall efficiency of public-sector financial operations.",
   "summary_zh": "该项目汇集公共部门的重要专业人员，包括财务主管、内部审计主管、会计人员、预算官、财务经理及其他相关官员。参与者还将接触新兴数字解决方案，这些方案能够改进财务报告、预算执行、风险管理以及公共部门财务运营的整体效率。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "The workshop, facilitated by Ventures Consultancy Nigeria Limited, is holding at Tahir Guest Palace in Kano. The programme brings together key public-sector professionals, including Directors of Finance, Directors of Internal Audit, Accountants, Budget Officers, Financial Managers and other relevant officials. It is also expected to expose participants to emerging digital solutions that can improve financial reporting, budget implementation, risk management and the overall efficiency of public-sector financial operations. The initiative reflects the Yobe State Government’s efforts under Governor Mai Mala Buni to strengthen institutional capacity, modernise public administration and promote prudent management of public resources. Participants are expected to acquire practical knowledge and skills that will support the integration of technology-driven approaches into financial management processes across government institutions, thereby contributing to improved transparency, accountability and service delivery. We’ve got the edge. Get real-time reports, breaking scoops, and exclusive angles delivered straight to your phone. Don’t settle for stale news. Join LEADERSHIP NEWS on WhatsApp for 24/7 updates →",
