   "summary": "North Korea on Monday denounced a recent South Korea-U.S. combined military exercise that integrates South Korea's conventional military capabilities with U.S. nuclear capabilities, saying strengthening the North's nuclear capabilities is \"immutable\" against such a backdrop. DPRK stands for the Democratic People's Republic of Korea, the North's official name. South Korea and the U.S. conducted the tabletop exercise at the Joint Chiefs of Staff headquarters in Seoul from Sept.",
   "summary_zh": "朝鲜周一谴责韩国与美国近期举行的一次联合军事演习。该演习将韩国的常规军事能力与美国的核能力相结合，并称在这一背景下，加强朝鲜的核能力是“不可动摇的”。DPRK是朝鲜民主主义人民共和国的缩写，是朝鲜的官方名称。韩国和美国于9月在首尔参谋长联席会议总部举行了这次桌面演习。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "North Korea on Monday denounced a recent South Korea-U.S. combined military exercise that integrates South Korea's conventional military capabilities with U.S. nuclear capabilities, saying strengthening the North's nuclear capabilities is \"immutable\" against such a backdrop. DPRK stands for the Democratic People's Republic of Korea, the North's official name. South Korea and the U.S. conducted the tabletop exercise at the Joint Chiefs of Staff headquarters in Seoul from Sept. 29 to Oct. 2 to deter North Korean threats. All of this, he said, shows the North must keep its adversaries in check with stronger nuclear means. \"The reality teaches once again the underlying truth that strength is peace and peace is guaranteed only by strength,\" he warned. Strengthening that deterrent at an ever faster pace to counter existing and potential threats is an \"immutable\" national defense policy, he added",
