   "title": "New York City Mayor Mamdani secures Trump’s approval for visa for mother of slain Ghanaian teenager in Bronx",
   "url": "https://www.myjoyonline.com/new-york-city-mayor-mamdani-secures-trumps-approval-for-visa-for-mother-of-slain-ghanaian-teenager-in-bronx/",
