   "summary": "A member of the House of Representatives, Martins Esin, has sponsored a two-day capacity-building programme for 52 councillors in his Akwa Ibom constituenc Read More: https://punchng.com/akwa-ibom-rep-trains-52-councillors-on-legislation/",
