   "title": "US inmate Christa Pike says she woke up ‘confused and in pain’ after failed execution",
   "url": "https://www.myjoyonline.com/us-inmate-christa-pike-says-she-woke-up-confused-and-in-pain-after-failed-execution/",
   "domain": "myjoyonline.com",
   "source": "MyJoyOnline（加纳）",
   "published": "Fri, 30 Oct 2026 15:38:02 +0000",
   "_dt": 1793374682.0,
   "ageDays": 2.74,
   "summary": "US death row inmate Christa Pike has released her first public statement since her botched execution in September.",
   "summary_zh": "美国死囚犯克里斯塔·派克自今年9月执行死刑未遂以来首次发表公开声明",
   "summarySource": "index",
   "body": "US death row inmate Christa Pike has released her first public statement since her botched execution in September.",
